<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-901989" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title">  About Yalla Live application
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember213711315" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>My opinion in the program Yalla Life is very beautiful and its internal coordination is attractive and wonderful and the most beautiful of that management deal with members Thank you all special thanks to the management of Yalla Life and add only those pieces of gold price is very beautiful will not exploit any new person.</p>

  


