    </h3>

    <blockquote id="ember213711319" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>welcome! We are happy to be with you at yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live</p>

  


