  <blockquote id="ember213711328" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>I paid 8.99$ for recharging 1000 coins and didn’t get it until now for the fourth day of waiting and app support didn’t help for this problem they asked me to contact their EMAIL and never respond I contact apple support and waiting for action.</p>

  


